# #5851 R4 (a5e2e2ef's F1-F7): an idle leaf's read-only report fetch carries every bound an
# append response carries, for the closes the leaf carries.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestFetchReportOmitsUnstampedHigh
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
PERTURBS: FetchReport
SUMMARY: the idle leaf's report fetch omits the key-filtered unstamped high, so a stale donor's unrouted write, which only that high bounds (C4), lies below the fetched head and L free-advances past it unapplied
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, WithReportFetch = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, ReportU)]
    /\ ReportStale(a)
    /\ ft' = [ft EXCEPT ![a] = next - 1]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the fetch carries no unstamped high.
    /\ UNCHANGED seenU
    /\ ReportStale(a)
    /\ ft' = [ft EXCEPT ![a] = next - 1]
--- END
